# Karpathy Guidelines

- State assumptions where iOS and SwiftPM behavior differ.
- Implement the minimum requested behavior and avoid premature protocols.
- Keep edits local and preserve Swift concurrency isolation.
- Define behavior with XCTest before or alongside implementation.
- Run `swift test`; use Xcode checks when work touches signing, capabilities,
  assets, previews, or an iOS application target.
